  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-u4-q14', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 4, 'Plants around us', 'reading', 14, 'true_false', '阅读短文并判断正误。At our school garden, there is an apple tree and some flowers. Plants need air, water and sun. We water the flowers and plant new trees. The apple tree gives us apples.  (1) There is an apple tree in the garden. (2) Plants need only water. (3) The tree gives us apples.。', NULL, '["T","F","T"]'::jsonb, '(1) T  (2) F  (3) T', NULL, 2, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'reading', 'unit-4']::text[], NOW()),
