  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-u6-q07', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 6, 'Useful numbers', 'vocabulary', 7, 'multiple_choice', '“几岁”用英语怎么问  A. How old are you?  B. How many are you?  C. What colour are you?。', '["How old are you?","How many are you?","What colour are you?"]'::jsonb, '"A"'::jsonb, 'A', NULL, 1, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'vocabulary', 'unit-6']::text[], NOW()),
  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-u6-q08', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 6, 'Useful numbers', 'vocabulary', 8, 'multiple_choice', '整点 7 点可以说  A. It’s seven o’clock.  B. It’s seven years.  C. Seven yuan, please.。', '["It’s seven o’clock.","It’s seven years.","Seven yuan, please."]'::jsonb, '"A"'::jsonb, 'A', NULL, 1, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'vocabulary', 'unit-6']::text[], NOW()),
  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-u6-q09', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 6, 'Useful numbers', 'sentences', 9, 'fill_blank', '—How old are you?  —______  A. I’m eight years old.  B. I have eight.  C. It’s eight o’clock.。', '["I’m eight years old.","I have eight.","It’s eight o’clock."]'::jsonb, '"A"'::jsonb, 'A', NULL, 2, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'sentences', 'unit-6']::text[], NOW()),
  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-u6-q10', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 6, 'Useful numbers', 'sentences', 10, 'fill_blank', '—How many apples?  —______  A. Three.  B. I’m three.  C. It’s red.。', '["Three.","I’m three.","It’s red."]'::jsonb, '"A"'::jsonb, 'A', NULL, 2, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'sentences', 'unit-6']::text[], NOW()),
  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-u6-q11', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 6, 'Useful numbers', 'sentences', 11, 'multiple_choice', '购物时说“十元，谢谢”可以说  A. That’s ten yuan, please.  B. Ten years old, please.  C. Ten apples, please.。', '["That’s ten yuan, please.","Ten years old, please.","Ten apples, please."]'::jsonb, '"A"'::jsonb, 'A', NULL, 2, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'sentences', 'unit-6']::text[], NOW()),
  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-u6-q12', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 6, 'Useful numbers', 'sentences', 12, 'multiple_choice', '别人递给你东西时，你可以说  A. Here you are.  B. What colour is it?  C. How old are you?。', '["Here you are.","What colour is it?","How old are you?"]'::jsonb, '"A"'::jsonb, 'A', NULL, 2, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'sentences', 'unit-6']::text[], NOW()),
  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-u6-q13', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 6, 'Useful numbers', 'sentences', 13, 'multiple_choice', '生日聚会邀请中，最合适的表达是  A. Please come to my birthday party.  B. Please water my tree.  C. Please go to the zoo.。', '["Please come to my birthday party.","Please water my tree.","Please go to the zoo."]'::jsonb, '"A"'::jsonb, 'A', NULL, 2, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'sentences', 'unit-6']::text[], NOW()),
  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-u6-q14', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 6, 'Useful numbers', 'reading', 14, 'true_false', '阅读短文并判断正误。It is Lili’s birthday. She is seven years old. At seven o’clock, her friends come. There are one cake, two apples and three bananas.  (1) Lili is seven. (2) Her friends come at eight o’clock. (3) There are three bananas.。', NULL, '["T","F","T"]'::jsonb, '(1) T  (2) F  (3) T', NULL, 2, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'reading', 'unit-6']::text[], NOW()),
  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-u6-q15', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 6, 'Useful numbers', 'reading', 15, 'short_answer', '根据短文回答：How many apples are there?', NULL, '"There are two apples."'::jsonb, 'There are two apples.', NULL, 2, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'reading', 'unit-6']::text[], NOW()),
