  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-revision-q21', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 0, 'Being a good guest', 'final_review', 21, 'short_answer', '阅读：Mina has a small family. She lives with her mum and brother. She has a pet cat. The cat is black and cute. Mina likes her family and her cat. 判断：Mina has a big family. / The cat is cute. / Mina likes her cat。', NULL, '"F；T；T"'::jsonb, 'F；T；T', NULL, 3, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'final_review', 'revision']::text[], NOW()),
