  ('pep-grade3-first-term-2024-revision-q26', 'pep-grade3-first-term-2024', 0, 'Being a good guest', 'final_review', 26, 'listening', '听力：听朗读后选择。The child has a ______ family.  A. big  B. small  C. new。', '["big","small","new"]'::jsonb, '"A"'::jsonb, 'A', 'This is Ben. He has a big family. He likes apples. He has a pet rabbit. The rabbit can hop. Ben is seven years old. His birthday party is at seven o’clock.', 3, ARRAY['pep-appendix', 'final_review', 'revision']::text[], NOW()),
